  "title": "Qt: WelcomePage: Hide sidebar on initial construction",
  "description": "It's better to have the sidebar appear when the app is initialized;\nthe user might have the sidebar preferences to hidden, and it looks\nodd to have the sidebar briefly appear before vanishing.\n\nAlso, make sure that the layout is adjusted when changing the\npreferences. If resize events occurred while the sidebar was\nnot visible, they won't have been properly processed to affect\nthe layout.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
